s":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3276029722763\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3276029722763\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":411.11,"y":376.53,"cell":2287,"i":26,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3276029722287\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3276029722287\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":845.84,"y":157.87,"cell":168,"i":27,"name":"Hitch Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 19 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":699.97,"y":296.84,"cell":1477,"i":28,"name":"Zaj'ar'thaz Warg","tags":[],"note":"Rumors speak of a prime Warg who inhabits Zaj'ar'thaz hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":769.93,"y":315.47,"cell":1680,"i":29,"name":"Oreloremar Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Quenianism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":874.22,"y":495.54,"cell":3588,"i":30,"name":"Yeet'er Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Arachnid Spirits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":480.77,"y":409.02,"cell":2681,"i":31,"name":"Ekh-Khod Pinery","tags":[],"note":"A pinery sacred to local Orkish Deities."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":985.97,"y":225.06,"cell":765,"i":32,"name":"Nannor Leopards","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":291.83,"y":347.28,"cell":1963,"i":33,"name":"Gagkan Apes","tags":[],"note":"A gang of mounted highwaymen."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":246.04,"y":285.48,"cell":1240,"i":34,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":694.3,"y":530.5,"cell":3899,"i":35,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":346.12,"y":453.51,"cell":3172,"i":36,"name":"Nylmlulumyha Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2f\udc10\udc2d\ud802 \udc35\udc2b\ud802𐠥\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠔𐠕\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc37\ud802𐠐\ud802\ud802𐠿 𐠙\udc2b\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802  \udc1c\udc16𐠿𐠫\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":670.86,"y":441.73,"cell":2994,"i":37,"name":"Zhice Monument","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2a\udc2e𐠝\udc01\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠥𐠏𐠪\udc35\udc10 \udc04\ud802\ud802𐠟\udc2f𐠁\udc3f\udc27\udc24𐠃\udc08\udc0b\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc1b𐠟 \udc37\udc23\udc18\udc20\udc2b𐠎\udc1e</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":724.92,"y":352.73,"cell":2118,"i":38,"name":"Ruined City","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":730.9,"y":192.7,"cell":328,"i":39,"name":"Ruined City","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":645.28,"y":266.73,"cell":1100,"i":40,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":816.9,"y":256.65,"cell":1030,"i":41,"name":"Sratha Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":597.85,"y":223.08,"cell":723,"i":42,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":959.7,"y":436.2,"cell":2931,"i":43,"name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":656.93,"y":435.57,"cell":2893,"i":44,"name":"Ret'erno Melee","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of speed in Ret'erno, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":518.03,"y":274.48,"cell":1177,"i":45,"name":"Zaj'kissush Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Zaj'kissush, offering local wood, vinegar, and cheese alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":801.84,"y":145.08,"cell":95,"i":46,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Mithas River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":582.31,"y":321.84,"cell":1660,"i":47,"name":"Bears migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of bears are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":343.68,"y":256.26,"cell":979,"i":48,"name":"Jhanyx Cave","tags":[],"note":"The Jhanyx Cave. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":293.37,"y":460.08,"cell":3167,"i":49,"name":"Olhonelona Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":881.9,"y":410.24,"cell":2724,"i":50,"name":"Kheiqei Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":861.7,"y":214.99,"cell":650,"i":51,"name":"Erasemarran Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":803.96,"y":391.58,"cell":2521,"i":52,"name":"Rhiq Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":842.52,"y":448.63,"cell":3123,"i":53,"name":"Klishok Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":414.48,"y":238.31,"cell":795,"i":54,"name":"Solzesh Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":849.86,"y":234.27,"cell":847,"i":55,"name":"Kariondeneno Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":739.71,"y":517.59,"cell":3723,"i":56,"name":"Saqshisie Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":872.04,"y":542.45,"cell":4019,"i":57,"name":"Ancient Rift","tags":[],"note":"A rumoured ancient rift in this area is causing an emmissary to step through with an all-powerful relic."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":772.49,"y":146.57,"cell":92,"i":58,"name":"Disturbed Burial","tags":[],"note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":421.77,"y":350.28,"cell":1977,"i":59,"name":"Gramberming Crypt","tags":[],"note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":806.08,"y":446.99,"cell":3119,"i":60,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3119\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":605.1,"y":410.99,"cell":2694,"i":61,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2694\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":727.13,"y":529.32,"cell":3907,"i":62,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3907\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":887.77,"y":280.63,"cell":1311,"i":63,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1311\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":671.93,"y":353.81,"cell":2112,"i":64,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2112\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a9","type":"party","size":46,"pin":"pin","fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#d4351c","x":542.24,"y":540.82,"cell":3972,"i":65,"name":"The Party","tags":[],"note":"Current location of the adventuring party."}]
